      "notes": "10 requests/min/model on Tier 1. The medium text is 3 requests per run (one per sentence), so a 20 s pause keeps it near 8 req/min; use --texts short to go faster. Quota: 10 requests/min and, on this key's tier, 100 requests per model per day (GenerateRequestsPerDayPerProjectPerModel, measured 2026-10-28); an entry costs warmup+runs times 8 requests (the medium text is 3 per run), so --runs 10 (88 requests) is the most one day allows per model."
